----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Configuration        | Term   |   J |       Level (cm-1)   | Uncertainty (cm-1) | Leading percentages             | Reference
---------------------|--------|-----|----------------------|--------------------|---------------------------------|---------------------
                     |        |     |                      |                    |                                 |                     
1s2                  | 1S     |   0 |           0.0        |               9.9  | <b>100</b>                             |              <a class='bib' ONMOUSEOVER="self.status='EL Bibliographic Reference for Fe XXV'; return true;" ONMOUSEOUT="self.status='';return true;" TARGET="_blank"  HREF="javascript:void(0)" ONCLICK="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&db_id=21139&comment_code=&amp;element=Fe&amp;spectr_charge=25&amp;ref=21139&amp;type=E');return false">L21139</a>
                     |        |     |                      |                    |                                 |                     
